<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/bic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Business Identifier Code (BIC), also known as SWIFT-BIC or SWIFT code, is a unique 8 or 11-character alphanumeric code standardized by [ISO 9362](https://www.iso.org/standard/84108.html) to identify financial and non-financial institutions (e.g., `BBWCUS33`)."@en .
